# Generated bundles are consumed as-is (FC `node server/index.mjs`, EdgeOne Node
# Functions) and `npm run check:edgeone` compares them against a fresh build.
# Pin LF so a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true does not make the
# committed artifact differ from what esbuild emits.
server/index.mjs text eol=lf
node-functions/**/*.mjs text eol=lf
